renasync-gui is a lightweight GUI addon for Renasync. It keeps the terminal
hidden while you chat and watch: a small dialog picks a server, room and name
(saved connections are remembered), then the room window opens with the chat,
the online users and a shared playlist. mpv still opens in its own window as
usual.

The addon imports renasync at runtime, so the renasync package must be
installed separately (see multimedia/renasync).

WWW: https://codeberg.org/<your-account>/renasync-gui